msgstr "Réglages de publication en goutte-à-goutte"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:137
msgid "Enable automatic scheduling"
msgstr "Activer la programmation automatique"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:138
msgid "Posts per day"
msgstr "Articles par jour"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:139
msgid "Publishing time window"
msgstr "Plage horaire de publication"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:140
msgid "Start date"
msgstr "Date de début"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:141
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "Types de contenus"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:142
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Catégories"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:143
msgid "Assignment order"
msgstr "Ordre d'assignation"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:144
msgid "Failure recovery"
msgstr "Récupération après échec"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:145
msgid "Notification email"
msgstr "E-mail de notification"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:185
msgid ""
"Minimum posts per day cannot exceed the maximum. The maximum was raised to "
"match the minimum."
msgstr ""
"Le minimum d'articles par jour ne peut pas dépasser le maximum. Le maximum a"
" été augmenté pour correspondre au minimum."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:207
msgid ""
"The end time must be later than the start time. The previous time window was"
" kept."
msgstr ""
"L'heure de fin doit être postérieure à l'heure de début. La plage horaire "
"précédente a été conservée."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:257
msgid ""
"The notification email address is not valid. The previous value was kept."
msgstr ""
"L'adresse e-mail de notification n'est pas valide. La valeur précédente a "
"été conservée."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:312
msgid "Automatically schedule drafts on a daily basis."
msgstr "Programmer automatiquement les brouillons au quotidien."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:324
msgid "Min"
msgstr "Min"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:329
msgid "Max"
msgstr "Max"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:332
msgid ""
"A random number of posts within this range will be scheduled each day "
"(1-50)."
msgstr ""
"Un nombre aléatoire d'articles dans cette plage sera programmé chaque jour "
"(1 à 50)."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:343
msgid "From"
msgstr "De"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:348
msgid "To"
msgstr "À"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:351
msgid ""
"Posts will only be scheduled within this daily time window (site time). At "
"least 15 minutes apart."
msgstr ""
"Les articles ne seront programmés que dans cette plage horaire quotidienne "
"(heure du site). Au moins 15 minutes d'écart."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:362
msgid ""
"The earliest date new posts may be assigned to. Existing scheduled posts are"
" never overwritten."
msgstr ""
"La date la plus proche à laquelle de nouveaux articles peuvent être "
"assignés. Les articles déjà programmés ne sont jamais écrasés."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:401
msgid ""
"Applies to the \"Post\" post type only. Leave empty to include all "
"categories."
msgstr ""
"S'applique uniquement au type de contenu « Article ». Laissez vide pour "
"inclure toutes les catégories."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:412
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Aléatoire"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:413
msgid "Oldest first"
msgstr "Le plus ancien d'abord"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:426
msgid ""
"Automatically republish posts that missed their scheduled publish time."
msgstr ""
"Republier automatiquement les articles qui ont manqué leur heure de "
"publication programmée."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:428
msgid ""
"Adopted posts (see \"Scheduled (site-wide)\" above) are covered by failure "
"recovery once imported."
msgstr ""
"Les articles adoptés (voir « Programmés (sur tout le site) » ci-dessus) sont"
" couverts par la récupération après échec une fois importés."

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:439
msgid ""
"Email address to notify when posts are recovered. Leave empty to disable "
"notifications."
msgstr ""
"Adresse e-mail à prévenir lorsque des articles sont récupérés. Laissez vide "
"pour désactiver les notifications."

#: includes/class-phdrip-watchdog.php:47
msgid "Every 15 Minutes (PressHangar Draft Pacer)"
msgstr "Toutes les 15 minutes (PressHangar Draft Pacer)"

#. translators: 1: site name, 2: number of recovered posts.
#: includes/class-phdrip-watchdog.php:152
#, php-format
msgid "[%1$s] PressHangar Draft Pacer recovered %2$d missed post(s)"
msgstr "[%1$s] PressHangar Draft Pacer a récupéré %2$d article(s) manqué(s)"

#. translators: %d: number of recovered posts.
#: includes/class-phdrip-watchdog.php:159
#, php-format
msgid ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer detected %d post(s) that failed to publish on their "
"scheduled time (likely a WP-Cron issue) and republished them immediately. "
"You may want to check that WP-Cron is running reliably on your site."
msgstr ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer a détecté %d article(s) qui n'ont pas été publiés à "
"l'heure programmée (probablement un problème de WP-Cron) et les a republiés "
"immédiatement. Vous voudrez peut-être vérifier que WP-Cron fonctionne de "
"manière fiable sur votre site."

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Prise en main"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer publishes your backlog of drafts automatically, "
"spaced out at natural, human-like intervals — with a watchdog that makes "
"sure nothing is missed. It never generates content. New here? These few "
"steps get you going."
msgstr ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer publie automatiquement votre réserve de brouillons, "
"espacés à des intervalles naturels et réalistes — avec un chien de garde qui"
" veille à ce que rien ne soit oublié. Il ne génère jamais de contenu. Vous "
"débutez ? Ces quelques étapes vous lancent."

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Turn on automatic scheduling"
msgstr "Activez la programmation automatique"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"In the settings below, choose which post types and categories to pace and "
"how fast to publish, tick \"Enable automatic scheduling\", then Save."
msgstr ""
"Dans les réglages ci-dessous, choisissez les types de contenus et les "
"catégories à cadencer et à quelle vitesse publier, cochez « Activer la "
"programmation automatique », puis Enregistrer."

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Schedule your current drafts"
msgstr "Programmez vos brouillons actuels"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"Press \"Run Assignment Now\" above to space out the drafts you already have."
" After that, new drafts are paced automatically every day."
msgstr ""
"Appuyez sur « Lancer l'assignation maintenant » ci-dessus pour espacer les "
"brouillons que vous avez déjà. Ensuite, les nouveaux brouillons sont "
"cadencés automatiquement chaque jour."

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Make sure posts publish on time"
msgstr "Assurez-vous que les articles sont publiés à l'heure"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"Drip publishing relies on WordPress cron. If \"Cron health\" above shows a "
"warning, follow the External Cron Setup Guide on this page — the built-in "
"watchdog still rescues any missed post in the meantime."
msgstr ""
"La publication en goutte-à-goutte s'appuie sur le cron de WordPress. Si « "
"État du cron » ci-dessus affiche un avertissement, suivez le Guide de "
"configuration du cron externe sur cette page — en attendant, le chien de "
"garde intégré rattrape tout article manqué."
